prompt:
Write an original story for upper elementary aged children (9-12 years old). The length should be approximately 400 words. The theme is graveyard of talking skeletons. The style should be appropriate for the children's reading level and include figures of speech that are observed at this reading stage.
//
//
Make the main character complex (not one dimensional) and fully-fledged.
//
//
Subtly introduce a lesson about the making most of the time you have. 
//
//
Revise the story so that the atmosphere is more spooky, creepy.
//
//
Make the side-characters more ominous and morally ambiguous. Focus more on the dialogue.

